     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I’m building a Shiny App. However, there is something which\r\ndoesn’t work and I hope someone can help me out. <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">At the first button, it must be possible for the user to\r\nenter a number. This I have done through the following code:<u></u><u></u></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#First button  </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>numericInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;numberofx&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Number of x&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"> </span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">When someone enters 1, the next button (the selectInput button) must appear once. But\r\nif someone 2 enters at the first button, this (second) button must appear twice and so on. This second button must therefore be displayed just as often as entered in the first button. This is the second button:<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"color:#000\">selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;kind&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>      label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;kind&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br>              </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>              </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font></div></code></div><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">I was thinking about something like:</p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$numberofx</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\">selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;kind&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>                         label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;kind&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                         choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                           </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br>                           </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                           </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                         selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)}</span></div></code></div><span style=\"font-family:monospace;background-color:rgb(250,250,250);color:rgb(102,102,0)\"><br></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">But that&#39;s not working </span><span style=\"font-size:16px\">unluckily</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">. Could someone help me with this?</span></font></div><div><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" size=\"4\"><b><u style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">This is the full code:</u></b></font></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> navbarPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Invulformulier&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>             <br>             <br>             numericInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;numberofx&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                          label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Number of x&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                          value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>             <br>             </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#This widget should appear in the app as often as it is entered in the previous widget</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>             selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;kind&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                         label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;kind&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                         choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                           </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br>                           </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                           </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Choice 3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                         selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>             </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><font size=\"6\">Many thanks in advance!!</font></div></div>"
